[{"title":"送郑太史归毗陵 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"隐儿江楼记绝峰，飙轮谁识去来踪。\n得酬海上三山会，游戏仙人绿玉龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31118,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑太史归毗陵 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"朝暾夜月叩蒿莱，袖里芙蓉两不猜。\n不是洞门扃岁月，几人曾访玉书来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31119,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑太史归毗陵 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"自种因缘亦似僧，丈夫身世岂无凭。\n桄榔林下堪栖憩，重话菩提一夜灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31120,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑太史归毗陵 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"芳桂应移楚客心，木兰新倚越人吟。\n思君清梦飞南岭，得似罗浮雪片深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31121,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇祯元年元日立春歌 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"一统常逢第一编，春王正月繫元年。\n何如三朔班春候，累叶中兴岂偶然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31122,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇祯元年元日立春歌 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"拜舞今朝乐有馀，农耕堪试卜牛初。\n君王已自除珰虎，不比徒闻宽大书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31123,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人日旧好诸君携酒过","author":"陈子壮","text":"草堂何日不幽清，朋好新年娱晚晴。\n三纪已凭双眼过，一尊莫照二毛生。\n诗篇尽我随君和，春洞飞梅带雪声。\n谁信论才非用世，逃虚无计谢时名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31124,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诸君再过","author":"陈子壮","text":"流水轩车破隐沦，夭桃未必胜迷津。\n疏灯杂雨难为夜，比舍留欢是此旬。\n词客情随芳草合，小儿歌进太平新。\n烟花若问长安丽，一谪金门亦有因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31125,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灯夕过区嘉霁","author":"陈子壮","text":"春色高斋已十分，九衢车马漫纷纷。\n烧灯有意留明月，度曲真成伴彩云。\n宝树峥嵘偏自爱，玉山倾倒为谁醺。\n相过里闬寻常事，今夜何其一问君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31126,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"汉季朝廷轻，随风倾李杜。\n一朝党构成，歼夷尽颍汝。\n含诟独吊丧，全宥乃无数。\n以彼道广人，行谊或容与。\n褰裳而几先，天地随吐茹。\n不见申屠蟠，飙若灵鸟举。\n生名杀我身，永佩严公语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31127,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"狄公绛侯手，产禄牝朝当。\n伟哉国老名，虎口不见伤。\n絮书得金字，势足杀二张。\n承反何悒壹，褫裘何赫煌。\n不待吉琐言，已归庐陵王。\n明前种桃李，默默为安唐。\n堪笑娄郝辈，长厚安所将。\n幸自免罗织，尺寻不可偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31128,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智海修六若惺三上人过访同赋得风雨亦来过","author":"陈子壮","text":"独坐千林色，堂虚小景偏。\n冲泥今雨兴，剪烛故人缘。\n是否龙听法，依稀鸟弄烟。\n三湘图画里，看竹更天然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31129,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过木之濠想亭留题十四韵","author":"陈子壮","text":"曲水绕城南，徐卿此结庵。\n前临九曜石，浑是百花潭。\n净泶閒鱼戏，和飔绕燕諵。\n罗衣缘控带，苔发沐䰐鬖。\n竹屋窥张荐，棋枰对李憨。\n风流家五柳，真率客双柑。\n逸格萧萧出，文思处处覃。\n玉壶一片在，赤水几回探。\n求友诗俱和，惊人句自耽。\n书床开罨画，衣桁泊烟岚。\n夙有深山约，聊为委巷谈。\n春畦分药得，新盏别泉甘。\n清乐偕晨夕，馀欢醉二参。\n东郊游兴早，车马任骖驔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31130,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悠悠曲 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"何日不悠悠，江花江上流。\n借问桃花坞，几度木兰舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悠悠曲 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"春阴亦已缓，春草亦已长。\n良夜非三五，起视明月光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悠悠曲 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"昔夕真何夕，规缺又三分。\n记得殊未满，那当持赠君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悠悠曲 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"八行锦字多，一字珠百斛。\n就里拈一珠，时时向花卜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智海入罗浮送以四偈 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"浩劫微尘本自该，钵头何以向山隈。\n说来海上曾浮峤，方信人间有渡杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智海入罗浮送以四偈 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"鲍葛丹炉他自封，法云长引入山钟。\n閒将一滴曹溪水，飘落罗浮四百峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智海入罗浮送以四偈 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"咫尺迢遥不可知，飙轮相就更何时。\n好游最是东坡子，生长眉山不到眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"智海入罗浮送以四偈 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"世外无情更有情，梅花清影立三更。\n劳君一喝空山月，又见扶桑海上生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诃林新辟禅社吴用潜玺卿十虚上人继至","author":"陈子壮","text":"佛日香林报夕曛，灵花祇树倍缤纷。\n千年笔授人如见，七叶衣传偈亦闻。\n繫马从参都讲席，行瓢方乞募缘文。\n由来十八高贤会，莫遣延之咏五君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为弈客黄生赠父","author":"陈子壮","text":"自爱君家万顷陂，交游随处识牛医。\n传中若个添高士，书就分明达武夷。\n箕踞科头看世上，双柑斗酒听莺时。\n丈人可是无机事，瓜葛还争数道棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送袁自如少司马还朝","author":"陈子壮","text":"曾闻缓带高谈日，黄石兵筹在握奇。\n回纥传呼惟郭令，召公受策自淮夷。\n追锋北向趋三事，露布东征宠六师。\n此去中兴麟阁待，燕然新勒更何辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李都护小像","author":"陈子壮","text":"任取丹青与画师，虬髯燕颔世间知。\n肯将三尺芙蓉剑，空作并州游侠儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴","author":"陈子壮","text":"楼阁妆春胜画图，雕龙鹦鹉太相呼。\n不知院落鞦韆影，金舄花钿定有无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"花发津亭几树殷，十千容易醉红颜。\n江南江北如相忆，只在莺莺燕燕间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"霸国江山锦作堆，一春无恙几登台。\n木棉花落啼山鹧，歌舞冈前许再来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"楼下春郊白马嘶，楼上佳人玉箸啼。\n自是王孙归未得，肯将芳草怨萋萋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"春望望江江水流，柳条难繫木兰舟。\n侬今欲采蘼芜去，忽漫相逢拾翠洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其五","author":"陈子壮","text":"三万六千醉不辞，劝君行乐及君时。\n年来怕作秋风赋，已入潘郎鬓里丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其六","author":"陈子壮","text":"游冶儿郎亦太颠，骑马看花已十年。\n北客昨来还借问，皇州春色尚依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留春词 其七","author":"陈子壮","text":"花开花落一禅龛，欲结三年半日谈。\n爱水情根如不了，依稀来證老瞿昙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得首厦犹清和","author":"陈子壮","text":"羲氏鞭日车，滔滔次南陆。\n暄美良有馀，恢台如未足。\n阑薄泛敷与，历历庭端木。\n栖顿有延景，经营无畏旭。\n虽耘下噀田，恒啸东林竹。\n若榴殷书荣，红芭粲朝霂。\n偃仰天宇下，游戏滮池曲。\n幽廊带合弛，新沚缨斯濯。\n既展茂对情，信与风候睦。\n更获同怀素，时哉以为勖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赐环纪恩 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"万里天南拜诏频，丁年袍笏又从新。\n栖迟厚禄曾非据，诖误微名蚤见伸。\n有父固应闻讽议，无才终不老閒身。\n庭旋车马休嫌隘，自是先朝草莽臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赐环纪恩 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"豢养君恩涕泪馀，中兴犹复问樵渔。\n天怜部党俱弛禁，人喜名家渐拜除。\n咨访辄当裴垍识，疏慵无籍子公书。\n而今一忆元都树，未信刘郎恨不如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"欲将","author":"陈子壮","text":"海国春无旱，连春旱不任。\n举天云汉咏，匝地桔槔心。\n繁露皆儿戏，重溟有盗侵。\n欲将双泪眼，洒作一朝霖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读黎君选中州诸咏作 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"入市恰同公子辔，游梁初上孝王台。\n临风不用思贤达，独把新诗次第裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读黎君选中州诸咏作 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"广文先生囊不空，閒携童冠咏春风。\n相传洛下书生语，尽解人颐七字中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴玺卿兼寄何宫谕 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"木脱山中屐，高怀见玺卿。\n梧江清瘴远，莲社碧云生。\n览德辉千仞，承恩醉五城。\n和诗金马侧，应自问同声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴玺卿兼寄何宫谕 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"禁侍吾乡彦，皆称贺世仪。\n日来殷大礼，君去赴清时。\n星月班阶候，风云殿柱移。\n弹冠吾敢晚，犹恋菊花期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尚书怀","author":"陈子壮","text":"嚼实图何略，呼名谱未谐。\n不争妃子笑，得入尚书怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黎仲赐","author":"陈子壮","text":"黎仲者谁子，将来夺宋香。\n饱自宜村舍，心先献尚方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北望台","author":"陈子壮","text":"台端夹双柳，冉冉为成阴。\n佳月能无碍，閒轩时独临。\n冠裳明主意，枹鼓故园心。\n俛仰堪天地，谁知此夜深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菩提坛纳凉","author":"陈子壮","text":"百年偕净侣，三伏辟红尘。\n即此袈裟地，谁为褦襶人。\n有声都作雨，无日不留春。\n随意幡风动，端宜扫石论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日曾元鲁方伯邀同修若二上人黄弈客阁集","author":"陈子壮","text":"夏阁兀平林，清谈白昼深。\n晴山当一面，风翠恰盈襟。\n鹤过时留影，蝉移不辍吟。\n看君有真赏，弈旨与禅心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得莎鸡振羽","author":"陈子壮","text":"天生群动应，不独女郎丝。\n微细关人意，迁流赴尔时。\n三秋催转急，六月振先知。\n暑憩花阴值，宵行草露疑。\n是声增索莫，何事每凄其。\n为忆豳风句，沈吟星汉垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐冯诸君家弟送别三江舟中","author":"陈子壮","text":"徵书未许遂微情，尊酒还劳劝远行。\n梦寐五更呼手板，江湖何日不心旌。\n梅花短笛风物折，莲叶扁舟水自盈。\n莺谷鸰原多羽翮，薄言天际有离声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹溪 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"佛性无南北，繇来不二门。\n抽衣图得宝，酌水已忘源。\n大地逢人说，空山有偈存。\n疏钟祇树下，看堕听经猿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31166,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曹溪 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"祖法初航日，恰从南海湄。\n涅槃真有信，辗转复于兹。\n只履犹前度，归根正及时。\n可怜同净域，瞻拜在临歧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31167,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与俛无夜坐寄示诃林诸衲","author":"陈子壮","text":"宝林经雨宿，声色净诸峦。\n心杂辞灵运，身轻忆懒残。\n水田僧结夏，金粟鸟分餐。\n为报菩提种，生生覆戒坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31168,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭上","author":"陈子壮","text":"朱明不尽曲江头，生长能为柞棫谋。\n谂是越裳梯贡路，至今一线頫神州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圆通寺","author":"陈子壮","text":"一叠新泉有妙音，残僧疏磬越萧森。\n到来欹枕松窗里，知入庐山更几深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东林寺","author":"陈子壮","text":"胡为安午饭，无乃复东林。\n莲花窥诸品，如发远公心。\n点滴六时漏，迢遥三笑音。\n僧莫但饶舌，空看何费寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳曲","author":"陈子壮","text":"扬州大艑截珂峨，窗屋连簿上水歌。\n为人只道招夫婿，心比长江九派多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潜山道中遇雨","author":"陈子壮","text":"半天鸣籁四畴摇，一望翻澜众渴消。\n道上逢人堪假盖，水边何事更悬瓢。\n农家翠竹编初就，佛国青山步不遥。\n借问行行车马客，依稀还叱旧溪桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿青口驿楼","author":"陈子壮","text":"众鸟归飞信自繇，红尘才散即清幽。\n山围皖伯天连树，人岂庾公月满楼。\n欲见长安多似日，蘧然一宿乍宜秋。\n只今吴楚东南会，歧路非关历国愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其一","author":"陈子壮","text":"积岁官租此岁偿，青青无土复抽秧。\n知他莂尽禾中草，若个丁儿出手强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其二","author":"陈子壮","text":"淮北抛荒已渐多，争乾争雨奈时何。\n东庄秫薥西庄麦，愁向南人说稻禾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其三","author":"陈子壮","text":"片片蜻蜓尔但嬉，踰田跨野拣新枝。\n蜻蜓未解将身化，撼树西风忆尔时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其四","author":"陈子壮","text":"遍地连蔓瓜色新，啖瓜休问种瓜人。\n道傍纵有高轩过，遮莫柴门野草茵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹枝词 其五","author":"陈子壮","text":"屋冷鸦飞村路长，大姑行嫁细姑忙。\n茜红不耐单衫子，撞著前头铁裲裆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃山驿虓虎飞鹰掣似儿，等閒帏幄笑谈时。桃山亦近符离在，莫倚遗宫泣宋师。一作“遗宫亦近符离在，莫倚朱仙泣宋师”谷城山","author":"陈子壮","text":"消息弓藏鸟尽馀，椎嬴筹汉等何如。\n谷城原在行尘里，黄石还疑世外书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东平逢陆景邺老师","author":"陈子壮","text":"幕府莲花近已开，旧时桃李可能培。\n冲炎不似山阴棹，叱蹇仍追蓟北台。\n庙算探囊无一二，时艰问路免迂回。\n职方诸将关宸顾，匡济山东正论才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"近京","author":"陈子壮","text":"泥雨浃旬馀，晨光发玉除。\n两行瀛海树，一饭鄚州鱼。\n漫刺烦相向，乔柯想旧居。\n识途高马齿，努力尚盐车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赐鲥鱼","author":"陈子壮","text":"一入班联已素餐，更循资序即鸿磐。\n寸心何以献天子，尺尾初传荣讲官。\n日下南船兼驿至，宵分宫烛数筹欢。\n亲闱七箸今回首，旅食先尝凭报难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈廉茹太史兄弟奉寿尊甫涧云先生","author":"陈子壮","text":"太邱道广宜贤后，二子声名挂北斗。\n吴中四姓不足豪，汉家万石兹能有。\n安歌鼓瑟罗中堂，文茵锦胜粲而双。\n报导金华暂辞直，莱衣犹似鹭鹓行。\n国琛元圃照人如，共传出蚌报恩珠。\n不信试看沧海月，岁岁年年春满壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题纸壁十二韵","author":"陈子壮","text":"全生珍木上，寄食碧梧栖。\n脆甲宜莴苣，明汤有蒺藜。\n步工司隶马，斋禁太常妻。\n按策占云物，封章刻日圭。\n渐鸿行自得，凡鸟到曾题。\n爱我多扪舌，忧天或噬脐。\n孔周徒梦见，李杜枉名齐。\n舍馆先人泽，遗籯谏草携。\n未知承顾问，已事得参稽。\n鬒变将秋叶，丹披问露荑。\n奋身随八极，秉性乃中闺。\n消息皆天意，何当道路迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘半舫大司空总督河道","author":"陈子壮","text":"殿履新高面拜除，转咨臣计重河渠。\n蛟龙始识陵园在，鸿雁终招泽国居。\n棠蔽东人更竹马，葭明韦曲自橇车。\n可知识贡千艘入，不碍飞流九派如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":31186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]